# 電子手帳 (design 11.23), for tools/ui_run.py: letters of a 記入欄 carried
# into a figure of 基本図形編集, and the windows as they were left.
# The figure (画用紙, 100,100 to 900,700) is opened first; the 手帳's three
# windows come in front of it, the figure showing below the 予定表. The
# 氏名 of the 住所録 is carried onto the figure: a new piece of text stands
# where the outline's corner was, and the figure comes in front with the
# keys, as a window dropped on does; the 住所録 is pressed on its band to
# come back, then the 〒 is carried onto that piece and goes into it.
# The カレンダー moved, the 手帳 closed and opened again: its windows come
# back where they were left.
open 019a0f91-066f-706f-93da-ffe8150d6207
wait 2000
open 01a0d8c4-53c6-7a77-8b88-9cadbecf53c6
expect techo: ready 私の手帳
wait 800
wins
shot tf_start
click 700 503
expect techo: field addr 6
key 4A
key 4D 02
wait 200
hold 640 503
wait 100
move 620 503
wait 100
move 500 540
wait 100
move 320 560
wait 300
shot tf_carry
up
expect techo: carried text 青木 遥 (0)
expect figure: text dropped as a new piece (0)
wait 600
shot tf_dropped
# the figure the letters were dropped on came in front with the keys (design 10.4,
# dt_drop_keys): the 住所録 brought back by its band where the figure does not cover it
click 940 347
wait 300
front tf2 私の手帳（住所録）
expect ok tf2: in front
click 640 375
key 4A
key 4D 02
wait 200
hold 600 375
wait 100
move 580 375
wait 100
move 450 500
wait 100
move 340 566
wait 300
up
expect figure: text dropped into a piece (0)
wait 600
shot tf_dropped2
# the カレンダー moved by its name band, the 手帳 saved and closed, opened again
drag 600 80 640 110
wait 300
win 私の手帳（カレンダー）
key 08 01
wait 800
key 28
expect techo: places kept
expect techo: closed
wait 800
open 01a0d8c4-53c6-7a77-8b88-9cadbecf53c6
expect techo: ready 私の手帳
wait 800
wins
win 私の手帳（カレンダー）
shot tf_reopened
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
